---
code: field.name.snake-case
description: Convert field names to snake_case, keeping acronyms as one word (URLValue -> url_value)
default-enabled: false
---

# Mainstream snake_case: separators, camel humps and acronym boundaries are all
# word boundaries (displayName -> display_name, URLValue -> url_value).
# Jackson's SnakeCaseStrategy is the outlier (urlvalue); that legacy behaviour
# remains available as tool.camel2Underline for existing rules.
field.name=groovy:```
    return tool.toSnakeCase(it.fieldName())
```
